# Print colours

Use these colours for printed material, such as a household guide or a label for a device, or in custom formats where it is appropriate. For screens, use [Web colours](colour-web.html).

Each colour except White has a CMYK and a Pantone reference. Every value is the GOV.UK print palette, unchanged.

